{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_vayne_bolts": {
        "attack": "【圣银弩箭测试版】普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>。被动 <#ff9028ff>暗夜猎手<>：附近有敌方英雄时<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移动速度+8%<>。<#ff9028ff>圣银弩箭<>：<#ffb900ff>3.5秒<>内对同一目标连续第<#ffb900ff>3<>次命中（普攻、技能都算）额外造成<#f5f5f5ff>50<>的<#f5f5f5ff>真实伤害<>，对英雄再加<#f5f5f5ff>7%<>最大生命值。",
        "skill2": "用大弩射出重箭，对敌方英雄造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>击退<>；撞到墙（地图的墙、5v5 地图的四边）才再受到<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% 攻击力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理伤害<>并<#ef5350ff>眩晕<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>，没撞墙只击退。",
        "ult": "【附加包】<#ffb900ff>8秒<>内<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻击力+25%<>，技能冷却缩短<#ffb900ff>50%<>，<#ff9028ff>闪避突袭<>附带<#ffb900ff>1秒<><#ffb900ff>隐身<>，暗夜猎手的移速变为<#ffb900ff>3倍<>。期间她<#ffb900ff>3秒<>内打过的英雄阵亡（击杀或助攻），终极时刻延长<#ffb900ff>4秒<>，最多<#ffb900ff>8秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_vayne_bolts": {
        "attack": "【聖銀弩箭測試版】普攻造成<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>。被動 <#ff9028ff>夜之狩獵<>：附近有敵方英雄時<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>跑速+8%<>。<#ff9028ff>神聖銀箭<>：<#ffb900ff>3.5秒<>內對同一目標連續第<#ffb900ff>3<>次命中（普攻、技能都算）額外造成<#f5f5f5ff>50<>的<#f5f5f5ff>真實傷害<>，對英雄再加<#f5f5f5ff>7%<>最大生命。",
        "skill2": "用大弩射出重箭，對敵方英雄造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>擊退<>；撞到牆（地圖的牆、5v5 地圖的四邊）才再受到<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% 攻擊力<>的<#ff9028ff>物理傷害<>並<#ef5350ff>暈眩<><#ffb900ff>1秒<>，沒撞牆只擊退。",
        "ult": "【附加包】<#ffb900ff>8秒<>內<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻擊力+25%<>，技能冷卻縮短<#ffb900ff>50%<>，<#ff9028ff>翻滾瞄準<>附帶<#ffb900ff>1秒<><#ffb900ff>隱形<>，夜之狩獵的跑速變為<#ffb900ff>3倍<>。期間她<#ffb900ff>3秒<>內打過的英雄陣亡（擊殺或助攻），死亡通緝延長<#ffb900ff>4秒<>，最多<#ffb900ff>8秒<>。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_vayne_bolts": {
        "attack": "[Silver Bolts test build] Basic attacks deal <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<>. Passive <#ff9028ff>Night Hunter<>: <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>8% Move Speed<> while an enemy champion is near. <#ff9028ff>Silver Bolts<>: every <#ffb900ff>3<>rd hit in a row on the same target within <#ffb900ff>3.5s<> (attacks and abilities) deals <#f5f5f5ff>50<> <#f5f5f5ff>true damage<> more, plus <#f5f5f5ff>7%<> of a champion's max health.",
        "skill2": "A heavy bolt from her great crossbow deals <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>70% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> to an enemy champion and <#ef5350ff>knocks it back<>; only if it hits a wall (the map's walls, the 5v5 map's edges) it takes <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>35% AD<> <#ff9028ff>physical damage<> more and is <#ef5350ff>stunned<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<>. No wall, no stun.",
        "ult": "[Add-on] For <#ffb900ff>8s<> Vayne gains <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>25% AD<>, her ability cooldowns are <#ffb900ff>50%<> shorter, <#ff9028ff>Tumble<> makes her <#ffb900ff>invisible<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and Night Hunter's speed is <#ffb900ff>3x<>. Each champion takedown within <#ffb900ff>3s<> of her damaging them meanwhile extends Final Hour by <#ffb900ff>4s<>, up to <#ffb900ff>8s<>."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_vayne_bolts": {
        "attack": "[은화살 테스트판] 기본 공격은 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 100%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 입힙니다. 기본 지속 효과 <#ff9028ff>어둠 사냥꾼<>: 근처에 적 챔피언이 있으면 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>이동 속도 8%<>. <#ff9028ff>은화살<>: <#ffb900ff>3.5초<> 안에 같은 대상에게 연속 <#ffb900ff>3<>번째 적중(기본 공격·스킬)마다 <#f5f5f5ff>50<> <#f5f5f5ff>고정 피해<>, 챔피언에게는 최대 체력의 <#f5f5f5ff>7%<> 추가.",
        "skill2": "큰 석궁으로 무거운 화살을 쏴 적 챔피언에게 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 70%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 입히고 <#ef5350ff>밀쳐냅니다<>. 벽(지도의 벽, 5v5 지도의 가장자리)에 부딪혀야 <#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력의 35%<> <#ff9028ff>물리 피해<>를 더 입고 <#ffb900ff>1초<> <#ef5350ff>기절<>. 벽이 없으면 밀쳐내기만 합니다.",
        "ult": "[확장] <#ffb900ff>8초<> 동안 <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>공격력 25%<> 증가, 스킬 재사용 대기시간 <#ffb900ff>50%<> 감소, <#ff9028ff>구르기<> 후 <#ffb900ff>1초<> <#ffb900ff>투명<>, 어둠 사냥꾼 이동 속도 <#ffb900ff>3배<>. 그동안 <#ffb900ff>3초<> 안에 피해를 준 챔피언 처치에 관여하면 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 연장(최대 <#ffb900ff>8초<>)."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_vayne_bolts": {
        "attack": "【シルバーボルトテスト版】通常攻撃は<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の100%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>。パッシブ <#ff9028ff>ナイトハンター<>：近くに敵チャンピオンがいると<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:speed_0><#ffffffff>移動速度8%<>。<#ff9028ff>シルバーボルト<>：<#ffb900ff>3.5秒<>以内に同じ相手への連続<#ffb900ff>3<>回目の命中ごとに<#f5f5f5ff>50<>の<#f5f5f5ff>確定ダメージ<>、チャンピオンには最大体力の<#f5f5f5ff>7%<>を追加。",
        "skill2": "大型クロスボウの重い矢で敵チャンピオンに<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の70%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>と<#ef5350ff>ノックバック<>。壁（マップの壁、5v5マップの端）にぶつかった時だけ<#ff9028ff>30<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力の35%<>の<#ff9028ff>物理ダメージ<>、<#ffb900ff>1秒<><#ef5350ff>スタン<>。壁がなければノックバックのみ。",
        "ult": "【拡張】<#ffb900ff>8秒<>間<i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>攻撃力25%<>増加、スキルのクールダウン<#ffb900ff>50%<>短縮、<#ff9028ff>タンブル<>で<#ffb900ff>1秒<><#ffb900ff>インビジブル<>、ナイトハンターの速度<#ffb900ff>3倍<>。その間に<#ffb900ff>3秒<>以内に攻撃したチャンピオンのキルに関与すると<#ffb900ff>4秒<>延長（最大<#ffb900ff>8秒<>）。"
      }
    }
  }
}
